# Module Completion Standard (v2)

A module **cannot be marked complete** unless it passes all applicable gates:

1. CRUD · 2. Security · 3. Workflow · 4. EI · 5. Audit · 6. Communications · 7. Docs · 8. Tests · 9. Accessibility · 10. Mobile · 11. Performance · 12. Extension · 13. UX · 14. Production

## Status model

`planned` → `building` → `feature-complete` → `crud-complete` → `workflow-complete` → `ei-complete` → `tested` → `production-ready` → `released`

Declare status only in `src/lib/platform/release/registry.ts`. Do not claim `production-ready` / `released` while gates fail.

## Required when shipping a module

- Feature doc: `docs/features/<module>.md`
- Lifecycle events in EI catalog + Workflow trigger mappings
- Server-side permissions + RLS signals
- Tests under declared `testPaths`
- Shared CRUD UI patterns; extension API for third parties
- Run `npm run validate:release`

Dashboard: `/dashboard/executive/release`
